{"id": "move-001", "type": "thinking_move", "partition": "thinking_moves", "title": "先要一个具体到能看见的例子", "text": "别从定义开始。先找一个能看见、能碰的东西（一滴水、一个弹簧、一张照片）。例子讲不清，说明还没懂。", "tags": ["思维动作", "方法", "先要一个具体到能看见的例子"], "source": "本项目整理（费曼的工作方式，见《费曼物理学讲义》）", "source_type": "方法", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "项目整理与判据，可帮提问，非原始史料", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 48, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "787b3ed23027674b"}
